# Emulation Flatpaks installed on first boot by bazz-first-boot-flatpaks.service.
# One app-id per line; blank lines and #-comments ignored.
# Configs (RetroArch.cfg, DuckStation settings, ES-DE gamelists) are restored
# from the migration backup into the data layer, not baked into the image.
#
# Only app-ids that EXIST on Flathub belong here — a bad id fails the install.
# Verified against `flatpak remote-ls flathub` 2026-08-30:
#   ES-DE        -> NOT on Flathub (AppImage only; see bazz-first-boot-appimages.sh)
#   DuckStation  -> NOT on Flathub (AppImage only; same script)
org.libretro.RetroArch
net.pcsx2.PCSX2
